<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid reveal">
      <div class="about-photo-wrap">
        <img
          src="/img/me-n-robot.jpg"
          alt="Sourojit Saha with robots"
          class="about-photo"
        />
        <div class="about-photo-card">
          <div class="about-photo-card-name">Sourojit Saha</div>
          <div class="about-photo-card-role">Robotics &amp; AI Engineer</div>
          <div class="about-photo-card-links">
            <a href="mailto:sourojit.saha@gmail.com" title="Email">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
            </a>
            <a href="http://www.linkedin.com/in/sourojitsaha" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="LinkedIn">
              <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/sourojit-saha" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="GitHub">
              <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">
        <div class="section-header">
          <p class="section-label">About</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Who I am</h2>
        </div>

        <p>
          I am a Robotics Engineer and the first engineering hire at
          <a href="https://swarmbotics.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Swarmbotics.ai</strong></a>,
          where I built robots from the ground up — from simulation to physical prototype.
          I hold a graduate degree from <strong>Carnegie Mellon University</strong>, where I developed
          a strong foundation in control theory, motion planning, computer vision, ML/AI, and SLAM.
        </p>

        <p>
          My hands-on experience spans RC cars, nano quadcopters, and Boston Dynamics SPOT.
          I have built multi-robot exploration systems with communications multiplexers and operator
          GUIs, implemented LQR controllers for drone stabilization, developed path planners for
          safe autonomous parking, and worked on heterogeneous multi-robot SLAM with real hardware.
        </p>

        <p>
          I am always looking for exciting opportunities to work on hard problems in robotics and
          autonomous systems — feel free to reach out.
        </p>

        <div style="margin-top: 1.75rem;">
          <a href="mailto:sourojit.saha@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Get in touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
